Package: glmmRRdiag
Type: Package
Title: Posterior-Predictive Recursive Residual Diagnostics for GLMMs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Ahmed", family = "Bani-Mustafa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "a.mustafa@au.edu.kw"))
Description: Prototype implementation of posterior-predictive recursive residual diagnostics for generalized linear mixed models. The package computes within-cluster posterior-predictive randomized residuals, component diagnostics, refit-calibrated component p-values, and a calibrated minimum-p omnibus statistic for supported random-intercept GLMMs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
